// Module a-atypical-overlap: atypical and overlapping presentations. Recognizing the finding
// that does not fit the leading diagnosis, naming it, and generating the alternatives it points
// to (stroke mimics and chameleons, and overlaps taught elsewhere in the course); then the
// cognitive biases that cause premature closure and simple habits that counter them.

